{"version":1,"content":"<p>鍾嘉欣將於明年3月6日舉行《Remember 記得巡迴演唱會》，首次踏上紅館舞台圓夢。</p><p>她昨天於社交平台分享了一張多年前手捧紅館造型蛋糕的照片，並撰文感嘆夢想成真。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:23:45.352898+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:35:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.674451+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:01.781572+00:00","content_hash":"fc325b6b5176ecfa76b8a2d6d7852a28e93483c9c0d529593af5b3180626cc19","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}